## Hardware Design (CERN Open Hardware Licence v2 — Strongly Reciprocal)

Applies to: all PCB schematics, PCB layouts, Gerber files, and EasyEDA
project files (e.g. `hardware/`, `pcb/`, `*.sch`, `*.kicad_pcb`, `*.gbr`)

Full license text: [LICENSE-hardware.md](./LICENSE-hardware.md)

Summary: You may use, study, modify, and distribute these hardware design
files, provided that any derivative hardware designs are released under the
same CERN-OHL-S v2 license and that all modifications are documented.

---

## Enclosure & Documentation (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International)

Applies to: all 3D model files, CAD exports, drawings, images, and written
documentation (e.g. `enclosure/`, `docs/`, `*.stl`, `*.step`, `*.pdf`,
`*.md` files other than source code configs)

Full license text: [LICENSE-docs.md](./LICENSE-docs.md)

Summary: You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose,
including commercially, as long as you give appropriate credit to the
original author (Steven Keates / Capsule Corp AI Journal project).

